@startuml
title MW-11 - Daily Briefing

start
:Click "Daily briefing";

:Aggregate tasks, schedule and productivity profile;
:Compute suggestions, priority tasks and tasks missing time;

if (Any task missing time?) then (Yes)
  :Show the group of tasks missing time;
else (No)
  :Hide the group of tasks missing time;
endif

:Show the suggestions and the list of tasks to do;
:Label the reason for each task;
:Show today's schedule;

:Read the briefing and decide what to do today;

stop
@enduml
